      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm not sure I follow the market metaphor. Can you get more specific on the actual chemistry? Specifically, how does temperature affect the metabolic rate of the Lactobacillus versus the yeast? I need to know if a warmer environment is favoring the acid production too much.",
